OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIsolated early showers across
OL,6,FEssex, otherwise dry start. Then heavy
OL,7,Frain spreads northeast, possibly
OL,8,Foccasionally thundery. Rain clears by
OL,9,Fevening with widespread showers
OL,10,Ffollowing, these often very heavy,
OL,11,Fthundery with gusty winds. Becoming
OL,12,Fwindy later along the east coast.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FShowers, often heavy and
OL,15,Fthundery, die away leaving generally
OL,16,Fdry and cloudy conditions. Then
OL,17,Foutbreaks of mostly light rain will
OL,18,Farrive, mainly across northern areas.
OL,19,FWindy initially along eastern coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
