OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FCloudy start with early patchy
OL,6,Frain soon clearing away. Then bright
OL,7,For sunny spells develop, along with
OL,8,Fscattered showers, some of which may
OL,9,Fbecome heavy and thundery.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FBright
OL,12,For sunny spells and scattered showers
OL,13,Feach day, these sometimes heavy and
OL,14,Fthundery on Monday, otherwise mainly
OL,15,Flight. Breezy at times with
OL,16,Ftemperatures generally around normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
